            "review_text": "Peter M\n13 contributions\n0\nUpmarket Bia Hoi experience\nDec 2014 • Friends\n6-8 cold beers on tap including Tiger, Carlsberg, Budweiser, Sapporo and others and an above average bar menu, ask at very reasonable prices. \n\nThe staff look like a Vietnamese version of an American bar in matching orange and white costumes. Very fast service.\n\nAs 90 % of the customers are Vietnamese don't expect perfect service as the one or two tables of foreigners, however you will have a great night if you are patient and settle in for a good session, the staff are very eager to take care of you. \n\nSome previous reviews are not consistent with my 6-8 visits, I have always had very fresh food, good quantities and no regrets.\nRead more\nWritten December 14, 2014",
