            "review_text": "John L\nHanoi, Vietnam15 contributions\n0\nExpensive poor quality food\nNov 2014 • Friends\nOrdered a half chicken. As its a western style restaurant I expected a half chicken to turn up. instead I get the scraps of a chicken covered in an inch thick deep fried batter. I got chicken head, two chicken feets and the rest was bits of ligament. It was disgusting. we ordered a salad and when the waiter approached the table a bar maid ran over, grabbed the salad dressing and poured the whole content over the salad. the salad was swimming in this disgusting white sauce. good luck complaining in person! they dont speak a word of english. yet everything including the advertisements are in English. Asked for the bill and was left waiting for ten minutes. I had to then chase after the waitress to get my change.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 14, 2014",
