            "review_text": "SH M\n1 contribution\n0\nmy worst experience in Hanoi\nSep 2014 • Solo\nVuvuzela in Hoan Kiem was my worst food and service experience in Hanoi. \n\nAll kinds of staff walking around and one has to wait a minute to get seated in an almost empty restaurant. It took 4 minutes to get a receipt for the payment. \n\nExcept the Russian salad, the rest of the food e.g. kebabs were awful. What kind of meat was that really?!!!\n\nMy general experience of most restaurants in Hanoi has been exceptional and kind service. I am not sure how Vuvuzela managed to get this low in service. I even complained to the food service manager & he shrugged off his shoulder ... \n\nThe only thing that is good is the design of the place & the new chairs & tables.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 4, 2014",
