            "review_text": "EdK_IL\nCicero, IL431 contributions\n0\nVietnam-Style Hooters\nSep 2014 • Friends\nThis is definitely a clone of Hooters, with waitresses wearing white shirts and orange hot pants. Nice size selection of local and foreign beers, big screen TVs, plus what I would call the Vietnamese version of bar food. I was the guest of some friends so I can't tell if they have buffalo wings on the menu, but if not, the Vietnamese version of bar food is plenty good and filling. There is a bar or you can sit at tables if you're in a group. Oh, and the bathroom experience is definitely unique.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 8, 2014",
