            "review_text": "Oscar_El_Vagabundo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12 contributions\n0\nCold, Draft beer, great atmosphere, comfortably furnished, great corn chips\nJul 2014 • Friends\nCold, Draft beer, great atmosphere, comfortably furnished, great corn chips. Unfortunately, we ate prior to going there and had only room for beer and snacks. The menu made us want to come back again to eat. The corn chips are the best that I have ever had. The drafts are done right and the staff is on the ball. The place was busy when we were there, yet the service did not suffer. A very nice place for the middle class. No backpackers, no one bothering you buy lottery tickets or trinkets, the staff come when you look for them, and don't bother you except for the occasional smile. I like the smiles. I really liked the value.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 3, 2014",
